// TODO v0.5: Event Anchor Engine
// TODO v0.6: Fractal Child Structure Engine
// TODO v0.7: Range Story Engine
// TODO v0.8: NCI Breakout/Pullback Engine
// TODO v0.9: NCI Supply/Demand Engine
// TODO v1.0: Story Decision + Visual Engine
